msgid "# Sequence Parallelism"
msgstr "# 序列并行"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid "## How to use"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid ""
"Sequence Parallelism (SP) shards the token dimension across tensor-parallel\n"
"ranks around the communication boundaries of transformer layers."
msgstr ""
"序列并行（SP）在 Transformer 层的通信边界处，将 token 维度切分到各个张量并行\n"
"（TP）rank 上。"

msgid ""
"On vLLM Ascend, SP currently covers the MoE path (SP MoE). The attention\n"
"`o_proj` ends with a TP all-reduce, so its inputs are replicated on every TP\n"
"rank. Feeding those replicated tokens directly into the experts duplicates\n"
"compute and communication under expert parallelism. SP MoE keeps the expert\n"
"inputs sharded by sequence and restores the expected layout at the MoE output\n"
"boundary instead."
msgstr ""
"在 vLLM Ascend 上，SP 目前覆盖 MoE 路径（SP MoE）。注意力层的\n"
"`o_proj` 以一次 TP all-reduce 结束，因此其输入在每个 TP\n"
"rank 上都是复制的。在专家并行下，将这些复制的 token 直接送入专家会重复\n"
"计算和通信。SP MoE 则保持专家输入按序列切分，并在 MoE 输出\n"
"边界处恢复预期的布局。"

msgid ""
"**The original flashcomm feature overlapped functionally with the SP feature"
" and has been deprecated since v0.27.1.**"
msgstr "**原有的 flashcomm 功能在功能上与 SP 功能重叠，自 v0.27.1 起已废弃。**"

msgid "## Principle"
msgstr "## 原理"

msgid ""
"SP MoE shards the input along the token dimension in each\n"
"Transformer layer. Different TP ranks therefore process different tokens,\n"
"avoiding duplicate expert computation for the same tokens."
msgstr ""
"SP MoE 在每个 Transformer 层中沿 token 维度切分输入。因此不同的 TP rank\n"
"处理不同的 token，避免了对相同 token 的重复专家计算。"

msgid "The main data flow of an MoE layer is:"
msgstr "MoE 层的主要数据流为："

msgid ""
"Different DP ranks may have different numbers of valid tokens. Therefore, the\n"
"buffer after all-gather cannot be treated as a contiguous sequence of valid\n"
"tokens; it must be unpadded and zero-padded according to each rank's local\n"
"token size. This keeps tokens sequence-sharded during expert computation and\n"
"reduces duplicate computation and unnecessary communication."
msgstr ""
"不同的 DP rank 可能拥有不同数量的有效 token。因此，all-gather 之后的\n"
"缓冲区不能被视为连续的有效 token 序列；必须根据每个 rank 的本地\n"
"token 数量进行去填充和零填充。这样可以在专家计算期间保持 token 按序列切分，\n"
"并减少重复计算和不必要的通信。"

msgid "Steps to follow to enable SP currently:"
msgstr "目前启用 SP 需遵循的步骤："

msgid ""
"- `tensor_parallel_size > 1` and `data_parallel_size > 1`.\n"
"- `enable_expert_parallel` is set (MoE models only).\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"enable_flashcomm1\": true}'` set `flashcomm1`"
msgstr ""
"- `tensor_parallel_size > 1` 且 `data_parallel_size > 1`。\n"
"- 设置了 `enable_expert_parallel`（仅限 MoE 模型）。\n"
"- `--additional-config '{\"enable_flashcomm1\": true}'` 设置 `flashcomm1`"

msgid "### Temporary FlashComm switch (Ascend only)"
msgstr "### 临时 FlashComm 开关（仅限 Ascend）"

msgid ""
"Until SP support is fully validated, vLLM Ascend keeps SP MoE option by "
"original flashcomm option."
msgstr "在 SP 支持完全验证之前，vLLM Ascend 通过原有的 flashcomm 选项保留 SP MoE 选项。"

msgid ""
"To opt into upstream SP MoE, set one of the following (the\n"
"`additional_config` form is preferred):"
msgstr ""
"要启用上游 SP MoE，请设置以下其中一项（推荐使用\n"
"`additional_config` 形式）："

msgid ""
"This switch is temporary and deprecated. Referencing either form logs a\n"
"`FlashComm is deprecated` warning from `init_ascend_config`, and the override\n"
"carries a `TODO` to remove it once SP is supported — after that, the upstream\n"
"configuration above takes effect directly."
msgstr ""
"此开关是临时的且已废弃。引用任一形式都会从 `init_ascend_config` 记录一条\n"
"`FlashComm is deprecated` 警告，并且该覆盖项带有一个 `TODO`，一旦 SP 得到支持\n"
"就将其移除——此后，上述上游配置将直接生效。"
